WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
In 2022, Russia cut the
gas it piped to Europe.

2
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.940
From August 2022 to March 2023,

3
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.520
the EU used 17.7 per cent
less gas than the average

4
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.560
for those months in recent years.

5
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.080
Factories and homes cut their use.

6
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.730
Ships brought in gas from other countries.

7
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:23.390
No one gives the orders for
millions of choices like these.

8
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.300
So with no one in charge,

9
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.740
how do millions of
buyers and sellers end up

10
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.800
producing what people want?

11
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.820
In this mission, you'll
watch one shock to a market

12
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.430
set off three separate reactions.

13
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.610
Then you'll shift demand yourself,

14
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:41.200
and see how a gap between
buyers and sellers closes.

15
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: find out
what coordinates it all.
